# Line endings are LF everywhere, including on a Windows checkout.
#
# Two things in this repository depend on it. The CI step that regenerates every generated file and
# then asserts `git diff` is empty would otherwise report every one of them as changed on Windows,
# because codegen writes LF and the checkout holds CRLF. And the golden tests, the locale
# catalogues and the specification are compared as text.
#
# This was not a precaution. A Windows job failed on a regex that reads a file line by line,
# because `.` in a JavaScript regular expression does not match a carriage return.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never converted and never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dmg binary
*.AppImage binary
